00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:28.160
Um, oh yeah, and for you for uh for

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.710
people who are relatively new to CS, the

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:32.629
last thing you need to be doing is doing

