people were widely using AI models for

00:17:18.799 --> 00:17:22.789
coding. I don't uh this okay this is AI

00:17:22.799 --> 00:17:26.309
gen but this is AI gen from the the port

00:17:26.319 --> 00:17:32.950
not from the original code

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:34.960
I mostly like if I'm just skimming that

