employee is an absolutely terrible

00:23:55.760 --> 00:23:57.909
engineer.

00:23:57.919 --> 00:23:59.430
Like I wouldn't even want the average

00:23:59.440 --> 00:24:02.149
Fang engineer touching our code base.

00:24:02.159 --> 00:24:04.710
Um, let alone be like, you know,

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:06.710
actually trying to be one of the major

00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:11.110
